  - Deep, structured architectural recommendations for **Point 3 (`\"ZONA NO DELIMITADA\"` in Multivariate Time Series — Fase 6)** comparing the 3 options (Option A: Reassign to official province/canton per 2015–2017 leyes de fijación de límites; Option B: Keep as a separate category; Option C: Discard) and why Option A (or provincial aggregation) is mathematically superior for multivariate time series (VAR, SARIMAX, GNN/spatial-temporal models) to avoid zero-inflated/truncated series.\n\n## 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- **Comment Style:** Always write thorough, pedagogical yet technically accurate Spanish comments on every new function, parameter, condition, and operation (avoiding childish analogies). Preserve all existing comments.\n- **Clickable Links:** All file paths and code symbols in user responses must use `[label](file:///D:/Tesis/...)` format with forward slashes.\n- **Data Immutability:** Never modify files in `data/raw/`.\n</summary>\n\nYou have the 5 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: agent]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/Alu/.gemini/antigravity/brain/f13cc2bc-2a33-43bd-9a7e-0aa042316f37/.agents/agents/geo_module_writer/agent.md\nLast Edited: 2026-11-06T15:35:24Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: fase3_resumen]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/Alu/.gemini/antigravity/brain/f13cc2bc-2a33-43bd-9a7e-0aa042316f37/fase3_resumen.md\nLast Edited: 2026-11-06T02:29:50Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: fase4_resumen]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/Alu/.gemini/antigravity/brain/f13cc2bc-2a33-43bd-9a7e-0aa042316f37/fase4_resumen.md\nLast Edited: 2026-11-06T16:12:24Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: fase5_resumen]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/Alu/.gemini/antigravity/brain/f13cc2bc-2a33-43bd-9a7e-0aa042316f37/fase5_resumen.md\nLast Edited: 2026-11-10T01:13:47Z\n\n[ARTIFACT: mapa_diagnostico_continental]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/Alu/.gemini/antigravity/brain/f13cc2bc-2a33-43bd-9a7e-0aa042316f37/mapa_diagnostico_continental.png\nLast Edited: 2026-11-10T00:56:53Z\n\n# Subagents\nThe following subagents were spawned d